  "contentHtml": "<p>지난번에 중3 생식과 유전 단원의 독서 수행평가 자료를 올렸었는데요~</p><p>허겁지겁 중2 물질의 특성 자료도 완성했습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>저희 학교는 사서선생님께서 학생수만큼 책을 구입해주셔서 수월했는데요!</p><p>최근에는 밀리의 서재를 구독하여 태블릿으로도 볼 수 있게 지원이 가능하다고 하니 방법은 많을 것 같습니다~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55653cd4dfa87fb8fa3c3e18ee14bf28eecbd4e5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55653cd4dfa87fb8fa3c3e18ee14bf28eecbd4e5\" data-origin-width=\"595\" data-origin-height=\"841\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c52dd1019695e154bee544ad0480efa445b0832e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c52dd1019695e154bee544ad0480efa445b0832e\" data-origin-width=\"595\" data-origin-height=\"841\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ee2dd7b37c47fa7a8f3c18cafd75d0127151c67\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ee2dd7b37c47fa7a8f3c18cafd75d0127151c67\" data-origin-width=\"595\" data-origin-height=\"841\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f6026f28f1f3c2f25cceb4e41a3b62ff6c7e4bc?download\" data-file-name=\"2022 2학년 과학 독서 활동지(물질의 특성).hwp\" data-file-size=\"2244608\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D234%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20220919151037&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6f6026f28f1f3c2f25cceb4e41a3b62ff6c7e4bc')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"